      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "I've found out why auto-hold has issues on my end for most scenarios. If you add other functionalities to a button (Double/Long/Held) that has the drop boolean assigned, it breaks auto-hold. If Drop is on it's own dedicated button, auto hold works as expected. \n\npicking up an item and immediately using it like the camera is still an issue, but at least I can hold things again.",
